      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A fast spinning dropkick that throws the target off balance.</p>\n<p>Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 3d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit. This <strong>Technique</strong> ignores <em>Proficiency Bonuses</em> to the target's <strong>AC</strong>.</p>\n",
